<title>UK: Eurofima sets 20 billion peseta 10-year capped FRN.</title>
<headline>Eurofima sets 20 billion peseta 10-year capped FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by joint lead managers Banco Central Hispano and CECA Ahorra Corporacion.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROFIMA</p>
<p> AMT    20 BLN PTA    BASE	*6M-LIBOR  MATURITY    10.APR.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN    *25 BP     PAY DATE    10.APR.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY =	   ISS PRICE  100.0     FULL FEES   20 BP</p>
<p> LISTING    AIAF	DENOMS (K) 100	 GOV LAW     SPANISH</p>
<p> NOTES     *CAPPED AT 8.45 PCT</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
